WEBVTT

00:15:58.589 --> 00:16:02.612
Mwen vle pale w de yon mòso nan dènye konvèsasyon ke mwen te fè ak Will.

00:16:02.612 --> 00:16:06.700
Se te jou yo te pral egzekite l la.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:11.012
Nou t ap pale,

00:16:11.012 --> 00:16:12.067
pa t gen anyen ankó pou nou te fè

00:16:12.067 --> 00:16:13.682
pou n te sove ka l la.

00:16:13.682 --> 00:16:16.033
Nou t ap pale de vi l. Premyéman li te pale de papa l,

00:16:16.033 --> 00:16:18.900
ke l pa t menm byen konnen,

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:19.733
ki te mouri.

00:16:19.733 --> 00:16:22.367
Nou t ap pale de manman l,

00:16:22.367 --> 00:16:24.131
ke l te konnen,

00:16:24.131 --> 00:16:26.300
ki toujou vivan.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:29.000
Mwen te di li:

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.051
mwen konnen istwa l la.